---
// Corpus fixture: not compiled, not run.
//
// An .astro file is the extension that made the unclassified count visible at all.
// Before it was classified, signpost had no reader for it and nothing downstream
// recorded that it had existed — so a repository whose entire landing page was two
// .astro files read as fully covered, and the bundle described that workspace as a
// single JavaScript module built from its config file with the pages unmentioned
// anywhere. It is source now, which is why this directory has a module page and why
// the corpus's unclassified count is two lower than it was.
//
// This file has no imports, which is deliberate: a layout is the root of a component
// tree and imports nothing from inside it. So the page for this directory exists on the
// strength of the extractor having run, not on the strength of an edge.
const title = "corpus";
---
<html>
  <head><title>{title}</title></head>
  <body><slot /></body>
</html>
